{"id": "fractals-phase-tag", "kind": "audit", "parity": null, "family": "Fractals + BTC phase", "provenance": "exported", "title": "BTC market-phase tags (cycle year, drawdown, Cowen band, 200/400-day and weekly averages): days in each cell", "date": "2026-10-31", "what": [{"name": "What it is", "value_plain": "A daily tag table used to split other tests by market phase; it is not a trade test and has no R.", "label": "OURS"}, {"name": "Causality", "value_plain": "The tag of day t uses only daily bars closed on day t-1 or earlier", "label": "OURS"}, {"name": "Halving dates", "value_plain": "2012-11-28, 2016-07-09, 2020-05-11, 2024-04-20 (block timestamps)", "label": "SOURCED"}, {"name": "Cycle year / drawdown bins", "value_plain": "1 + floor(days since halving / 365) capped at 4; drawdown from the running close-ATH: shallow above -20 %, mid -20 to -50 %, deep below -50 %", "label": "OURS"}, {"name": "Cowen band, averages", "value_plain": "Cowen band side (FORMULAS.md), 200-day and 400-day average side, weekly 10-average above/below and up/down", "label": "SOURCED"}, {"name": "Data", "value_plain": "BTCUSDT spot daily closes, 2017-08-17 to 2026-09-30", "label": "SOURCED"}], "how": "One row per UTC day. The harness checks that a changed bar t leaves the tag of day t alone but changes day t+1, that a planted edge in one cell is found 72 to 100 % of runs at the stated n, and that a no-edge run flags nothing. The P1 split itself was blocked until P1b supplied a frozen event list.", "window": "Tag series 2017-08-17 to 2026-09-30 (a descriptive table; the trade studies that use it stay on DEV 2022-01 to 2025-06)", "verdict": {"label": "Built and tested (15 tests); descriptive only, never a trigger", "tone": "info"}, "why": ["3332 daily rows; every cell describes where price sits, not a forecast.", "Only 2 to 3 cycles exist, so cycle-year cells are descriptive and never a rule.", "Used by P1b, F1 and F3 to split results by phase; none of them found a phase in which the tested trade turns positive."], "kpis": [{"label": "daily rows", "value": "3332"}, {"label": "tests passing", "value": "15"}, {"label": "planted edge found", "value": "72 to 100 % of runs"}], "examples": [{"kind": "table", "title": "Days per tag cell", "cols": ["Tag", "Cell", "Days", "Share"], "rows": [["cowen_side", "above", 1618, "48.6 %"], ["cowen_side", "below", 1412, "42.4 %"], ["cowen_side", "inside", 151, "4.5 %"], ["sma200_side", "above", 1637, "49.1 %"], ["sma200_side", "below", 1495, "44.9 %"], ["sma400_side", "above", 1902, "57.1 %"], ["sma400_side", "below", 1030, "30.9 %"], ["wsma10_phase", "above_up", 1403, "42.1 %"], ["wsma10_phase", "below_down", 1245, "37.4 %"], ["wsma10_phase", "above_down", 302, "9.1 %"], ["wsma10_phase", "below_up", 301, "9.0 %"], ["dd_bin", "deep", 1303, "39.1 %"], ["dd_bin", "mid", 1103, "33.1 %"], ["dd_bin", "shallow", 925, "27.8 %"], ["cycle_year", "2", 1056, "31.7 %"], ["cycle_year", "3", 893, "26.8 %"], ["cycle_year", "1", 730, "21.9 %"], ["cycle_year", "4", 652, "19.6 %"]], "caption": "Blank (nan) rows are the warm-up before each average exists."}, {"kind": "none", "title": "Examples", "caption": "no example trades exported"}], "source_files": ["MyTradingSys/research/fractals_2026-10-31/phase_tag/phase_tag.py", "MyTradingSys/research/fractals_2026-10-31/phase_tag/tags.csv", "MyTradingSys/research/fractals_2026-10-31/SYNTHESIS.md", "MyTradingSys/research/fractals_2026-10-31/p1_split/RESULT.md"], "commit": "614a11e65", "_trade_rows_in_file": 0}

